rooms_desc ({"You have entered the mysterious house of the mysterios legendary mage Mort.You feel strong mysterious magic everyvere.You can also see lots empty bottle of beer, wine, whisky and other kinds of alcohol on the ground. The drinks have been used to regenerate Mort'smyghty powers. There is a vt420 terminal in the corner. The terminal is on.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
